{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id406599648"}, "name":{"label":"Luke9284"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-11-09T06:42:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.55.0"}, "id":{"label":"10567059087"}, "title":{"label":"What a tricky agent !!! Booking Reference ID: AFA185566"}, "content":{"label":"Klook has a kind of admission ticket for Disneyland Shanghai named \"admission ticket - photo pass\". I thought that this was the entrance ticket, because I dont know the concept of \"admission ticket - photo pass\" which only allows people to get in a place and take photos there. Because of the misleading product title from Klook, I bought 2 admission tickets - photo pass\" for me and my wife (nearly $80). When I came to Disneyland Shanghai, Disneyland's staff said that we could not get in the park with \"photo pass\". We were too frustrated after a long time of queuing. Then after 30 minutes of struggling with Disneyland'staff, we finally could buy 2 real tickets, also on Klook. Disneyland's staff also said that I could ask Klook to refund 2 photo pass tickets to me because I didnt use them. Then I requested to get refund on Klook app with the reason option \"buy the wrong ticket\". However, they refused to refund to me. What a tricky agent !!! Goodbye forever !!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=961850126&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
